 # tags: rfd:scope
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2436) 'gate and its control.
 # tags: rfd:scope, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2436) 'Can two people see each other from a program that needs nothing else
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2436) 'in the beta?
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2436) 'RFD66606-2360 cuts the beta on seeing each other, and nothing built
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2436) 'yet carries it alone.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2436) 'Run the sight gate against a recorded pose stream. A zone that drops
 # tags: rfd:exit
