 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2436) 'presence is an independent native slice
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2436) 'Presence ships as one native program, a riscv64 guest ELF run
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2436) 'binary-translated, that owns the zone's people and their poses. It
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2436) 'runs with no voice, pen, party or shop (operator, 2026-11-01). The
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2436) 'details hold the host, the avatar and the ladder.
 # tags: rfd:decision
