 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-2436) '  it carries.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:21Z (RFD66606-2436) 'The rulings
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

