 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:25Z (RFD66606-2436) '  owns the zone's list of people and their avatar poses (operator,
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:26Z (RFD66606-2436) '  2026-11-01).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:27Z (RFD66606-2436) '- The slice runs with no voice, pen, adventure party or shop present.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:28Z (RFD66606-2436) '  Its inputs are recorded pose streams in place of those parts
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:29Z (RFD66606-2436) '  (operator, 2026-11-01).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:30Z (RFD66606-2436) '- Native means a riscv64 guest ELF for the sandbox, run
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:31Z (RFD66606-2436) '  binary-translated (operator, 2026-11-01). Its gates run on the CPU
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:32Z (RFD66606-2436) '  guest as the parity oracle (RFD66606-2374, RFD66606-2390).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:33Z (RFD66606-2436) '- The host is the win64 client of RFD66606-2360, and the zone it joins
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:34Z (RFD66606-2436) '  is a NixOS flake container under Ankaios (operator, 2026-11-26). The
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:35Z (RFD66606-2436) '  client is built natively for the win64 desktop, and
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:36Z (RFD66606-2436) '  the slice's gates run there too (operator, 2026-11-26).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:37Z (RFD66606-2436) '- An avatar is ANNY on the MS-Human-700 muscle skeleton, sent as 21
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:38Z (RFD66606-2436) '  entity Packets of 100 bytes. The zone only routes and four parties
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:39Z (RFD66606-2436) '  judge each sender (operator, 2026-11-13).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:40Z (RFD66606-2436) '- Melatonin is optional content, loaded onto the same guest with
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:41Z (RFD66606-2436) '  logic. ANNY is the beta avatar (operator, 2026-11-25).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:42Z (RFD66606-2436) '- The work climbs one ordered ladder from what already runs, one
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:43Z (RFD66606-2436) '  change a rung.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:44Z (RFD66606-2436) 'What the beta asks
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:45Z (RFD66606-2436) 'RFD66606-2360 says what the beta ships and on which devices. The slice
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:46Z (RFD66606-2436) 'holds the part that lets two people see each other and nothing more:
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:47Z (RFD66606-2436) 'who is in the zone, where each avatar stands, and the pose each person
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:48Z (RFD66606-2436) 'sends.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:49Z (RFD66606-2436) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:50Z (RFD66606-2436) 'The campus
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:51Z (RFD66606-2436) 'A campus is a world, and a world runs as instances. Any player starts
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:52Z (RFD66606-2436) 'an instance for friends, public or invite-only. One zone server is the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:53Z (RFD66606-2436) 'authority for one instance. Each instance keeps its own shop books.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:54Z (RFD66606-2436) 'One campus ships first, and building a campus stays with the V-Sekai
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:55Z (RFD66606-2436) 'content tools (operator, 2026-10-30).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:56Z (RFD66606-2436) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:57Z (RFD66606-2436) 'The slice's edge
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:58Z (RFD66606-2436) 'In: the zone's list of people, a pose from each, and a view of the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:00:59Z (RFD66606-2436) 'others for each person. Out: voice, outfits, seats and books, which
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:00Z (RFD66606-2436) 'are the sibling slices. The edge is a message shape between the zone
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:01Z (RFD66606-2436) 'and a client. It is the only contract the slice shares, and its first
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:02Z (RFD66606-2436) 'step writes it down.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:03Z (RFD66606-2436) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:04Z (RFD66606-2436) 'Gates and controls
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:05Z (RFD66606-2436) 'Each gate has a control that plants the defect and must fail.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:06Z (RFD66606-2436) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:07Z (RFD66606-2436) '- Sight: two clients replay a pose stream, and each client's view
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:08Z (RFD66606-2436) '  lists the other's avatar at the replayed pose. Control: a zone that
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:09Z (RFD66606-2436) '  drops one client's poses.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:10Z (RFD66606-2436) '- Alone: the program starts and passes its sight gate with every
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:11Z (RFD66606-2436) '  sibling slice absent. Control: a sibling's message planted in the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:12Z (RFD66606-2436) '  input, which the program must refuse by name.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:13Z (RFD66606-2436) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:14Z (RFD66606-2436) 'Frontier learning picks the runs
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:15Z (RFD66606-2436) 'The slice's gates run as levels in RFD66606-2309's sense, scheduled
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:16Z (RFD66606-2436) 'the way RFD66606-2323 schedules the store's attacks. A level is an
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:17Z (RFD66606-2436) 'input family with fixed attributes: the number of people in the zone,
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:18Z (RFD66606-2436) 'the pose rate, the client side (stream or desktop), and the loss
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:19Z (RFD66606-2436) 'pattern in the recorded pose stream. A problem is one 5 minute replay
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:20Z (RFD66606-2436) 'of a pose stream with a drawn seed and offset.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:21Z (RFD66606-2436) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:22Z (RFD66606-2436) 'Each level, its planted defect, and how the defect shows:
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:23Z (RFD66606-2436) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:24Z (RFD66606-2436) '- pose drop: the zone drops one client's poses; seen as a client's
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:25Z (RFD66606-2436) '  view missing the other avatar.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:26Z (RFD66606-2436) '- pose order: the zone swaps two poses; seen as an avatar at an older
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:27Z (RFD66606-2436) '  pose than the replay.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:28Z (RFD66606-2436) '- self echo: the zone lists a person to themselves; seen as a view
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:29Z (RFD66606-2436) '  that lists its own avatar.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:30Z (RFD66606-2436) '- late join: the zone skips the list for a late client; seen as a late
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:31Z (RFD66606-2436) '  client that sees nobody.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:32Z (RFD66606-2436) '- sibling input: a sibling's message is planted; seen as the program
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:33Z (RFD66606-2436) '  accepting it.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:34Z (RFD66606-2436) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:35Z (RFD66606-2436) 'Each level runs on the slice as it is and on the slice with that
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:36Z (RFD66606-2436) 'level's defect planted. On the planted target, success is the defect
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:37Z (RFD66606-2436) 'found. Regret `1[s ≥ 1] − s/n` over the last eight runs is high when a
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:38Z (RFD66606-2436) 'level finds its defect only some of the time. Mutation moves one
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:39Z (RFD66606-2436) 'attribute and is kept only when the planted find rate rises. A clean
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:40Z (RFD66606-2436) 'run counts only after its level found the planted defect in each of
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:41Z (RFD66606-2436) 'its last eight runs. A finding on the real slice is never averaged
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:42Z (RFD66606-2436) 'into a rate: it stops the lane and becomes a level that runs every
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:43Z (RFD66606-2436) 'time. The runs are guest ELF runs on the CPU guest, which is the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:44Z (RFD66606-2436) 'parity oracle, so no gate here needs a GPU.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:45Z (RFD66606-2436) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:46Z (RFD66606-2436) 'Where the code lands
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:47Z (RFD66606-2436) 'Each slice is a repository of its own in our organization, named for
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:48Z (RFD66606-2436) 'what it does with no game name, and pinned through the repo manifest.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:49Z (RFD66606-2436) 'It arrives as an ordinary pull request. V-Sekai repositories stay
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:50Z (RFD66606-2436) 'read-only.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:51Z (RFD66606-2436) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:52Z (RFD66606-2436) 'Since 2026-11-13 each part of this slice is a repository of its own
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:53Z (RFD66606-2436) 'too, started anew: the Packet codec, the zone router model, the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:54Z (RFD66606-2436) 'observer, the curve, the replica, the avatar follower, the relay in C,
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:55Z (RFD66606-2436) 'and the gates that join them on a real body. RFD66606-2493 says where
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:56Z (RFD66606-2436) 'the relay's parts are.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:57Z (RFD66606-2436) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:58Z (RFD66606-2436) 'What has run
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:01:59Z (RFD66606-2436) 'One real body has crossed the wire inside one process. A clip moves
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:02:00Z (RFD66606-2436) 'the muscle skeleton, its 21 parts go as Packets through the router
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:02:01Z (RFD66606-2436) 'model, the observers and the curve, and a second ANNY is posed from
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:02:02Z (RFD66606-2436) 'them 12 ticks behind. All 21 parts were drawn and no honest frame was
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:02:03Z (RFD66606-2436) 'refused. A part was 0.21 mm from the sender's on average and 9.1 mm at
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:02:04Z (RFD66606-2436) 'worst, and its rotation up to 185 milliradians off, because a rotation
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:02:05Z (RFD66606-2436) 'has no rate on the wire. Three planted defects each made the largest
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:02:06Z (RFD66606-2436) 'error at least forty times worse.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:02:07Z (RFD66606-2436) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:02:08Z (RFD66606-2436) 'A position is whole micrometres on the wire and is never a float, so a
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2436  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-01T00:02:09Z (RFD66606-2436) 'body 8 billion kilometres from zero comes back within a micrometre,
 # tags: rfd:details
